Description: Community-led hyper-hackable text editor
 Pulsar is a community-led continuation of the Atom text editor. It is a
 hackable editor built on Electron, with a large ecosystem of community
 packages installable through its bundled package manager (ppm).
 .
 This package installs the editor runtime (the pinned Electron bundled at
 build time) under /usr/lib/pulsar together with the pulsar and ppm
 command-line entry points, desktop integration files and icons.
